    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong> About </strong> </h2> Monster Cube has a simple promise, to put the demon that is boredom at bay.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Simple arrow controls </li><li> Scoring system </li><li> Addicting </li><li> No hassle with menus </li></ul><br>All that is required by you is to &quot;consume&quot; the incoming projectiles before they hit you 3 times...then it starts all over again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong> Premise </strong> </h2> You are a Cronenberg monster meat cube that devours incoming projectiles at an increasingly aggressive pace. With a simple control scheme using the basic arrow keys on a standard keyboard to devour the incoming projectiles in 4 directions. Inspired by the heavy hours tapping away on my own desktop icons while talking or thinking.<br><br>To start this game its a simple load and straight into the game with no menus just you with a Score and High Score counter. Compare your high score with friends or brag about each time you achieved a funny number.<br><br><strong> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Future</h2> </strong><br><br>Designed to be a simple experience while you talk with your friends in the background or simply want to reach a new high score future bug fixed and quality of life improvement are the primary goal.",
